```
unpacking comprehensions
↓
less intermediate code
↓
cleaner collection processing
```
**Performance analysis**  
PEP 799:  
```
profiling.tracing
profiling.sampling
↓
better performance diagnostics
```
**Native observability**  
PEP 831:  
```
frame pointers
↓
better native stack unwinding
↓
better profiling/debugging/eBPF visibility
```
Use profiling to verify whether the optimizations actually improve hyperNix-pip.  
Do not assume an optimization is beneficial without measuring it.  
   
